Subject: v2: swap chronik-bridge and chronik-cpp to V2 headers and outputs

Wires chronik-bridge FFI and chronik_bridge.{h,cpp} to 134-byte V2 headers
and native V2 CTxOut/CTxIn, and updates Chronik bridge unit tests,
Chronik functional suites, and the native V2 + Chronik E2E suite.
